    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math a bit intimidating, mostly because it felt disconnected from my daily life. I enjoy art and economics, so I see the practical use of math there, but it doesn’t really spark my interest like other subjects. I used to hate the rigid structure of equations. Now I'm trying to embrace it more, especially helping with my son's homework.",
